{"lines":[{"y":0.072674418460060064,"t":"Audioscripts","w":0.12139918009440105,"h":0.01453488398216074,"x":0.098765430420115083,"c":1},{"y":0.11454040002305321,"x":0.42171530470428092,"t":"TEST 6","h":0.018012223170699393,"c":1,"w":0.10307144800821938},{"t":"SECTION 1","y":0.17873969374285692,"h":0.016027748233718775,"c":1,"w":0.15226337432861331,"x":0.10288065856437223},{"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"x":0.10288065903370695,"t":"MAN:","y":0.2107558138494694,"w":0.037037035624186213},{"h":0.010402646867911591,"w":0.057693087259928374,"t":"WOMAN:","x":0.10284069875552644,"c":1,"y":0.22517658337484869},{"y":0.20324820089592355,"c":1,"x":0.18295011465848168,"t":"Good morning, Kenton Festival box office. How can I help you?","w":0.50034327189127603,"h":0.018679147053101808},{"c":1,"y":0.21860641375774692,"h":0.01926463680918844,"w":0.65246882120768235,"t":"Oh, good morning. I'm coming to Kenton for a few days' holiday next month, and a","x":0.18096755092969621},{"h":0.018596372278615658,"w":0.613392079671224,"x":0.17887165684582243,"y":0.23467063321208514,"t":"friend told me there's a festival. She gave me this number to find out about it.","c":1},{"c":1,"t":"MAN:","x":0.10288065904581055,"w":0.037037035624186213,"h":0.008720930389296444,"y":0.25726744175644622},{"c":1,"x":0.10493827119220597,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.2718023254696158,"w":0.057613169352213556,"h":0.010174418787512574},{"h":0.021974707379919578,"y":0.24773824036926462,"x":0.18084498304771993,"c":1,"t":"That's right, the festival begins on the 16th of May and goes on till the 19th.","w":0.58885355631510417},{"w":0.61758417765299478,"h":0.021870665892835706,"x":0.18090390661349487,"y":0.26320148021525913,"c":1,"t":"Oh, that's great. I'Il be there from the 15th till the 19h. So could you tell me the"},{"c":1,"w":0.16589753468831381,"t":"programme, please?","x":0.18255236194495017,"h":0.01755334856372559,"y":0.28313998015510256},{"y":0.30377906966342283,"h":0.0087209303892965551,"c":1,"t":"MAN:","w":0.037037035624186199,"x":0.10493827220243124},{"t":"Well, on the first day, there's the opening ceremony, in the town centre. People start","y":0.29590001380361075,"w":0.66894958496093748,"x":0.17891181466295764,"h":0.019162183656007303,"c":1},{"y":0.31151612531112649,"w":0.70186101277669266,"t":"gathering around 2 o'clock, to get a good place to see from, and the events will start Q1","x":0.18096520533285948,"h":0.018701479769146268,"c":1},{"y":0.32870629698833431,"w":0.2411310577392578,"x":0.18084517071663575,"h":0.017724881885470167,"c":1,"t":"at 2.45, and finish about 5.30."},{"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.010174418787512463,"w":0.059670778910319008,"y":0.34883720919205352,"x":0.10288065982467588},{"t":"MAN:","c":1,"y":0.36482558128972675,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.10493827220848302,"w":0.037037035624186213},{"y":0.342999855615016,"t":"OK, thanks. I'll make sure I get there early to get a good spot.","x":0.18098400248995256,"w":0.4898735046386718,"c":1,"h":0.017590837287678185},{"y":0.35895170802568255,"h":0.016048292108362672,"t":"The festival will be officially opened by the mayor. He'll just speak for a few minutes,","w":0.67078191121419262,"c":1,"x":0.18106994982450658},{"t":"welcoming everyone to the festival. All the town councillors will be there, and of","x":0.18096460068235673,"y":0.37350057423942096,"w":0.63192062377929681,"h":0.018609952308825561,"c":1},{"x":0.18106996307075998,"w":0.22222221374511716,"h":0.014534883982160851,"c":1,"t":"course lots of other people.","y":0.39244186032078887},{"c":1,"y":0.41133720920780659,"w":0.057613169352213542,"x":0.10699588435300465,"h":0.008720930389296444,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"t":"MAN:","x":0.10699588474983249,"y":0.42587209276225146,"w":0.03497942288716635,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"t":"Then there'll be a performance by a band. Most years we have a children's choir,","x":0.18096368194047291,"y":0.41968124042891564,"w":0.64831370035807301,"c":1,"h":0.017865856067311503},{"t":"but this year the local army cadets offered to perform, and they're very good.","y":0.43596225431982982,"h":0.019275215966681802,"c":1,"x":0.18302798876392018,"w":0.61334569295247388},{"w":0.057613169352213542,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.45784883711536006,"x":0.10699588435681505},{"x":0.10493827081558792,"w":0.039094651540120443,"c":1,"h":0.011627907185728592,"t":"MAN:","y":0.47238372078940327},{"w":0.6216102600097656,"x":0.18299624754533653,"t":"After that, a community group from the town will perform a play they've written","y":0.46614613423050766,"h":0.017401138098978364,"c":1},{"w":0.65683044433593751,"t":"themselves, just a short one. It's about Helen Tungate. ! don't know if you've heard","y":0.48044348491966071,"x":0.18291485150450418,"h":0.021775388324499434,"c":1},{"x":0.1823943333306586,"c":1,"t":"of her?","y":0.49954625462308955,"w":0.061216831207275391,"h":0.015056917327593289},{"w":0.057613169352213556,"x":0.10699588436062543,"c":1,"y":0.51889534874269028,"t":"WOMAN:","h":0.0087209303892965551},{"h":0.010174418787512574,"y":0.53488372081053959,"w":0.037037035624186199,"c":1,"x":0.10699588537720731,"t":"MAN:"},{"h":0.016318951394448389,"w":0.37879933675130206,"c":1,"y":0.51364290556186565,"t":"I certainly have. She was a scientist years ago.","x":0.18096168590395792},{"t":"That's right. She was born in Kenton exactly 100 years ago, so we're celebrating","x":0.1871543772504837,"y":0.52761639124344561,"w":0.63596018473307292,"c":1,"h":0.016247767301274196},{"w":0.11786240895589192,"y":0.54693663274484006,"x":0.18282852052000284,"h":0.014350765866300907,"c":1,"t":"her centenary."},{"y":0.56525202254533791,"x":0.10900557676492881,"c":1,"h":0.0090308385968067562,"w":0.055651397705078126,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"w":0.65667775472005208,"x":0.18298460407419384,"y":0.55848098168496663,"c":1,"h":0.019286691510635223,"t":"I'm a biologist, so l've always been interested in her. I didn't realise she came from"},{"t":"Kenton.","x":0.18488307986255043,"y":0.57752558195950265,"h":0.013501719956684366,"c":1,"w":0.06652675628662108},{"x":0.10699588538325912,"y":0.59593023243678411,"t":"MAN:","w":0.037037035624186213,"h":0.010174418787512574,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018284527516898685,"w":0.66070378621419279,"t":"Yes. Well, all that will take place in the afternoon, and later, as the sun sets, there'll","y":0.58966106344014979,"x":0.18507302452692945},{"h":0.017525414555597973,"c":1,"x":0.18507357446221676,"y":0.60532221440296152,"w":0.66686325073242192,"t":"be a firework display. You should go to the park to watch, as you'll get the best view"},{"h":0.018493985961267057,"c":1,"t":"from there, and the display takes place on the opposite side of the river. It's always","x":0.18503290165281763,"y":0.62013858444457959,"w":0.6587236531575521},{"h":0.016612441576271286,"c":1,"w":0.36651992797851562,"x":0.18502326123558477,"t":"one of the most popular events in the festival.","y":0.63713730125449053},{"w":0.19135801951090492,"t":"WOMAN: Sounds great.","h":0.013250883392226132,"y":0.65547703168551552,"x":0.10699588733531112,"c":1},{"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.69606996680673106,"x":0.11106607183091853,"w":0.057703247070312505,"h":0.0090228570504520267,"c":1},{"t":"MAN:","y":0.71220930222156242,"h":0.008720930389296444,"x":0.11111111170860406,"c":1,"w":0.037037035624186213},{"w":0.057653376261393219,"h":0.008854445355239049,"c":1,"y":0.75865417265588309,"x":0.11109100723960197,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"w":0.039094651540120429,"x":0.10905349716589657,"h":0.010174418787512463,"t":"MAN:","c":1,"y":0.77325581383026265},{"x":0.11304296740847998,"w":0.055807069142659496,"c":1,"t":"WOMAN:","y":0.80336008201235298,"h":0.0095589057014744405},{"c":1,"h":0.010174418787512574,"w":0.039094651540120456,"x":0.1090534971723266,"t":"MAN:","y":0.81976744173910965},{"y":0.83571274406233642,"w":0.055582523345947252,"h":0.0088070699828813881,"c":1,"x":0.11315524028170894,"t":"WOMAN:"},{"x":0.11316872465170016,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.03497942288716635,"c":1,"y":0.8502906975625073,"t":"MAN:"},{"x":0.11304082341721612,"y":0.86583584700861671,"w":0.057868970235188819,"t":"WOMAN:","c":1,"h":0.0096073757212069566},{"c":1,"t":"MAN:","x":0.1131687246610979,"h":0.008720930389296444,"w":0.03497942288716635,"y":0.89680232547577343},{"y":0.69186046495538278,"h":0.014558851648696969,"x":0.1851851856738683,"t":"And what's happening on the other days?","w":0.33333333333333326,"c":1},{"x":0.18918451380543247,"w":0.6442654927571615,"c":1,"t":"There are several events that go on the whole time. For example, the students of","y":0.70517150823474817,"h":0.01705905882854486},{"x":0.18505578166557218,"y":0.7205134700773802,"w":0.65663421630859387,"h":0.018001385094560729,"c":1,"t":"the art college have produced a number of videos, all connected with relationships"},{"h":0.017290664084246954,"c":1,"t":"between children and their grandparents.","x":0.1850424815583912,"y":0.73768368399520756,"w":0.33155977884928389},{"y":0.75137828491297465,"w":0.64016850789388025,"h":0.01899184551620936,"t":"That sounds interesting. It makes a change from children and parents, doesn't it!","c":1,"x":0.18712472869211827},{"c":1,"h":0.017867942580907181,"x":0.18717318988832404,"t":"Exactly. Because the art college is in use for classes, throughout the festival, the.","y":0.76717966257254178,"w":0.64415618896484372},{"t":"videos are being shown in Handsworth House.","x":0.18707002205760556,"y":0.78297972289551787,"h":0.017253277018157265,"w":0.37474690755208329,"c":1},{"x":0.18906384013157956,"w":0.22893058776855468,"h":0.015706817168650189,"c":1,"t":"How do you spell the name?","y":0.79925148978272487},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.56790125528971347,"c":1,"x":0.18724278848168638,"t":"H-A-N-D-S-W-O-R-T-H. Handsworth House. It's close to the Town Hall.","y":0.81389870418316146},{"x":0.18930041161130598,"t":"Right.","w":0.047325102488199877,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.83284883704565338,"c":1},{"h":0.018313141116264697,"t":"Now let me see, what else can I tell you about?","x":0.18705023472619578,"y":0.84478578650445846,"w":0.37903800964355472,"c":1},{"y":0.85861922331524787,"h":0.020057590605934594,"x":0.18709734620083102,"t":"Are there any displays of ballet dancing? I'm particularly interested in that as I do it","w":0.658794199625651,"c":1},{"t":"as a hobby.","c":1,"y":0.87904463982417147,"w":0.094821084340413392,"x":0.18921497217736924,"h":0.013713045311198879},{"y":0.89072989391996049,"h":0.017370309930808236,"c":1,"x":0.18919486068757388,"t":"There isn't any ballet, I'm afraid, but there'l be a demonstration of traditional","w":0.60925949096679688},{"c":1,"t":"dances from all round the country.","w":0.2739306640625,"h":0.016103561410353517,"x":0.1871021327312217,"y":0.90711856293390858},{"y":0.46656976726980082,"w":0.02880658467610675,"h":0.013081395583944833,"c":1,"x":0.85802469109816082,"t":"Q3"},{"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q4","y":0.51308139519962226,"x":0.8600823040510327,"c":1},{"t":"Q5","y":0.59011627891682561,"x":0.86008230426688503,"h":0.011627907185728592,"c":1,"w":0.02880658467610675},{"c":1,"y":0.76744186031590145,"t":"Q7","h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.02880658467610675,"x":0.86213991744352292},{"c":1,"y":0.89098837194008151,"h":0.011627907185728592,"w":0.026748971939086985,"t":"Q8","x":0.8662551435486322},{"c":1,"t":"Example","x":0.85346622643743009,"y":0.25013359879911867,"w":0.074934342702229761,"h":0.014786127178070707},{"x":0.11316872488338016,"t":"100","h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"y":0.94476744170203208,"w":0.037037035624186213},{"c":1,"h":0.017806331737864278,"x":0.39471442585841338,"y":0.96641811852927229,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.2085117212931315}],"w":2400,"h":3395}